      "data": {
        "text": "**Considering Logging Provider**\n\nI'm currently focused on selecting a managed logging service for this Python script, leaning towards Google Cloud Logging due to its popularity. The key is to make this choice concrete and easily identifiable within the `write_correlated_logs.py` file. I need to be sure that the service I choose can integrate with the correlation ID.\n\n\n**Defining Logging Provider Choice**\n\nI've decided on Google Cloud Logging as the managed logging service. My next step involves creating the `write_correlated_logs.py` file and implementing the logging logic with the Google Cloud Logging client library. I'm focusing on crafting a function that handles log content and the correlation ID, ensuring seamless integration.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789818460549,
          "start": 1789818459226
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0b97e545a0014EiJJ4GjGFQfox",
